<title>USA: TENNIS-HILTON HEAD ISLAND WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HILTON HEAD ISLAND WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HILTON HEAD ISLAND, South Carolina 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from $926,250 Family Circle Cup women's tennis</p>
<p>tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Barbara Schett (Austria)</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>13-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat 2-Arantxa Sanchez</p>
<p>Vicario (Spain) 6-2 5-7 6-0</p>
<p>14-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat 3-Jana Novotna</p>
<p>(Czech Republic) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>5-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) 6-0</p>
<p>5-7 6-4</p>
<p>7-Anke Huber (Germany) beat 9-Iva Majoli (Croatia) 3-6 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-3</p>
<p>Wiltrud Probst (Germany) beat 8-Irina Spirlea (Romania) 4-1</p>
<p>retired</p>
<p>:</p>
<p>Add third round</p>
<p>6-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) beat 12-Barbara Paulus (Austria)</p>
<p>6-2 6-4</p>
</text>
